# Topical events finder

Search a project archive only when there are enough projects to need it, and show each project’s status and dates. A finished upgrade must not read as current work. A short list of current projects is usually simpler than a finder. Scope, result count, empty states, focus and the no-JavaScript fallback follow the [shared finder behaviour](../finder.html#finder-shared-contract).

## When to use it

Use it for a bounded archive of maintenance or upgrade projects when there are too many to scan. Show each project’s status and date range.

## Home Assistant boundary

Do not infer household events from calendar text. Do not create an alert because an archived project matches a search.

